    "title": "Ripon Steals the Win From Livermore - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Harnoor Kaur ,\n2 days ago The Ripon High School Varsity Football team earned a hard-fought 27–24 win against Livermore on Friday night, August 28, 2026, in their first game of the season. Ripon came out strong in the first quarter, taking an early 14–0 lead. Livermore started to fight back in the second quarter, scoring 14 points, but Ripon answered with 10 points of their own. Going into halftime, Ripon held a 24–14 lead. Read full article",
